		dependency_error = ""
		description = "[b]Crafting in Modded v0.8.127-dev[/b] (dev / friends-only test build)

Modded crafting menus for Vermintide 2 — craft any career-eligible weapon with full control over its properties, traits, illusion, rarity, and power level. Uses the Athanor (Winds of Magic) forge UI plus a modded-realm standard Keep forge. Split from Weapon Tweaker. Requires VMF.

[b]How it works[/b]
• Press [b]B[/b] in the Keep (or Chaos Wastes hub) to open the Athanor, repurposed as a modded crafting menu. Hotkey is reconfigurable in the mod's VMF settings. Inside missions, both crafting surfaces follow Tweaker: GUI's experimental \"Allow crafting bench in mission\" option.
• Pick any career-eligible weapon from your character's full weapon pool, then dial in:
   – Power level (1–300)
   – Properties (Attack Speed, Crit Chance, Power vs. X, etc.)

