		description = "[b]Character Weapon Variants v0.1.526-dev[/b]

Registers new craftable weapon definitions grafted from cross-character models into lore-friendly, thematically appropriate packages. CWV supplies one 5-power Blacksmith copy of each weapon; craft additional owned instances through Crafting in Modded. Includes the Old Musket (toggle melee/ranged stance), Tuskgor Javelin, Sigmarite Greathammer, Longsword+Shield, Axe+Shield, and more.

[b]Features[/b]
- 20+ new cross-character weapon variants with unique models
- Old Musket: melee/ranged stance toggle via special key
- Custom illusion/skin pickers for cosmetic variants
- Per-weapon animation tuning + 3P transform overrides

