		description = "[b]Tweaker: Weapons[/b]

Cross-career weapon unlocks, animation remapping, and per-career scale/grip tweaks. Enables characters to wield weapons native to other careers with appropriate third-person animation redirection and stance handling. Requires VMF.

[b]Features[/b]
- Cross-career weapon unlocks
- Automatic third-person animation remapping
- Per-career weapon scale and grip-position tweaks
- Moonfire Bow AOE controls

